<item>
<title>Docker · Update Docker Engine to `v29.10.1` to fix container security and build errors</title>
<link>https://github.com/moby/moby/releases/tag/docker-v29.10.1</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">tip-2026-11-25</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:43:23 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<!-- tip-2026-11-25 -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Docker · Update Docker Engine to `v29.10.1` to fix container security and build errors</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#EEF1F6;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#EEF1F6"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 10px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#101828;border:1px solid #DCE2EC;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#101828" style="background:#101828;padding:14px 28px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">INSIGHTS OF THE DAY</td>
<td align="right" style="font-size:12px;color:#B8C2D6;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">Thu 26 Nov 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2 min read</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:18px 28px 0;">
<span style="display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#0A619F;background:#E3F1FB;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:10px;">Docker</span>
&nbsp;<span style="display:inline-block;font-size:12px;color:#17693B;background:#E3F4EA;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:10px;">Official source</span>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;">Update Docker Engine to <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">v29.10.1</code> to fix container security and build errors</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 28px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#27324A;">Docker Engine <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">v29.10.1</code> released on 24 Nov with fixes for host security vulnerabilities and engine bugs. The update upgrades BuildKit to <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">v0.35.1</code> and expands <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">docker login</code> to reference OATs authentication.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;">v29.10.1</div><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;">Docker Engine release</div></td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;">v0.35.1</div><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;">updated BuildKit version</div></td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:6px 10px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;">107</div><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;">commits to master since release</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="border-left:3px solid #0A619F;padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#0A619F;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WHY IT MATTERS TO YOU</div>Security flaws allow processes during <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">docker cp</code> to modify host directories behind read-only bind mounts. Image builds with <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">Expect: 100-continue</code> headers and concurrent <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">docker network rm</code> commands can also fail without this patch.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F0F4FF" style="background:#F0F4FF;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E4BE0;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">TRY IT IN 5 MINUTES</div>Upgrade to Docker Engine <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">v29.10.1</code>. Test <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">docker login</code> to view OATs authentication options, and confirm container builds succeed when uploading build contexts with <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">Expect: 100-continue</code> headers.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBE7E7" style="background:#FBE7E7;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A1414;"><div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#A42727;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">ACT TODAY</div>Upgrade immediately to fix <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">CVE-2026-135124</code> and <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">CVE-2026-135844</code>, preventing unauthorized host directory overwrites during <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">docker cp</code> and unbounded file reads.</td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#27324A;"><div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5F00;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">WATCH OUT</div><div style="padding-top:2px;">Hosts with <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">kernel.apparmor_restrict_unprivileged_unconfined=1</code> like recent Ubuntu releases block container processes from signalling or tracing each other until updated to <code style="font-family:Consolas,\'Courier New\',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#E9EEF7;color:#1F2A44;padding:1px 5px;">v29.10.1</code>.</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="border-top:1px solid #DCE2EC;padding-top:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5B6578;">Read: <a href="https://github.com/moby/moby/releases/tag/docker-v29.10.1" style="color:#2E4BE0;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Docker Engine releases</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
